<title>UK: Copper skips back up towards $2,300 on LME.</title>
<headline>Copper skips back up towards $2,300 on LME.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Perks back up to $2,300 level, with cash/threes widening out to $130/135 backwardation.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Snaps higher, looks to challenge $1,600.</p>
<p>ZINC - Advances smoothly, range still narrow.</p>
<p>LEAD - Hardly moving, consolidates after recent fall.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Cuts losses. TIN - Modestly higher.</p>
</text>
